- 嗯，我想要
来交易回来。

08:06.300 --> 08:08.533
There's only
one fair thing to do.
只有
一件公平的事情要做。

08:08.533 --> 08:10.433
- What's that?
- 那是什么？

08:10.433 --> 08:13.400
Patrick,
you call that fair?
帕特里克，
你说这公平吗？

08:13.400 --> 08:14.567
- I'm in charge.
- 我负责。

08:14.567 --> 08:17.367
- Ah...
Oh, yeah.
- 啊...
哦，是的。

08:17.367 --> 08:19.567
- Time for variable two.
- 变量二的时间。

08:19.567 --> 08:22.067
More free-a ice cream here.
更免费——这里有冰淇淋。

08:22.067 --> 08:25.067
Now in-a same sized cones.
现在处于相同大小的锥体中。

08:25.067 --> 08:27.867
- Huh?
I just got my slippers on.
- 啊？
我刚穿上拖鞋。

08:27.867 --> 08:31.167
- Here you go!
- I'll take those, my good man.
- 干得好！
- 我会接受的，我的好人。

08:31.167 --> 08:34.233
- Oh, but, Patrick, I--
- I'm in charge.
- 哦，但是，帕特里克，我——
- 我负责。

08:34.233 --> 08:37.100
- Uh, one cone, please.
- All gone!
- 呃，请给我一个甜筒。
- 全部消失了！

08:37.100 --> 08:39.433
- Ow!
- 噢！

08:39.433 --> 08:40.433
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

08:40.433 --> 08:42.067
For the love of Pete!
为了皮特的爱！

08:42.067 --> 08:43.733
- Can I have my cone now?
Can I have my cone now?
- 我现在可以拿我的甜筒吗？
我现在可以拿我的甜筒吗？

08:43.733 --> 08:45.533
Can I have my cone now?
Can I have my cone now?
我现在可以拿我的甜筒吗？
我现在可以拿我的甜筒吗？

08:45.533 --> 08:48.133
- Mm...
hmm...
- 嗯...
嗯...

08:48.133 --> 08:50.667
Rub my feet first.
- Oh, come on!
先揉脚。
- 哦，来吧！

08:50.667 --> 08:54.233
- Who's in charge?
- All right, I'll rub your feet.
- 谁负责？
- 好吧，我给你擦脚。

08:54.233 --> 08:55.700
Eww.
呃。

08:59.067 --> 09:02.533
Hey, my ice cream is melting
all over your hand.
嘿，我的冰淇淋融化了
遍布你的手。

09:02.533 --> 09:05.600
- Oh...
I'll fix that.
- 哦...
我会解决这个问题。

09:05.600 --> 09:09.067
- Patrick, you are making
very poor choices!
- 帕特里克，你正在做
非常糟糕的选择！

09:09.067 --> 09:10.567
- Don't you back-sass me!
- 你别跟我顶嘴！

09:10.567 --> 09:11.733
I'm in charge,
我负责，

09:11.733 --> 09:13.167
and you have to do
what I say.
你必须做
我说什么。

09:13.167 --> 09:17.067
Now...count that bucket
of white sand.
现在...数一下那个桶
白色的沙子。

09:17.067 --> 09:19.900
- All right,
I will.
- 好吧，
我会的。

09:19.900 --> 09:24.233
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,
1,893,601,
1,893,602,

09:24.233 --> 09:28.067
1,893,603.
1,893,603。
1,893,603。
1,893,603。
1,893,603。
1,893,603。
1,893,603。
1,893,603。

09:28.067 --> 09:29.833
Done!
Now to count the black sand.
完毕！
现在来数一下黑沙。

09:29.833 --> 09:31.067
- Oh, that's a pity.
- 噢，真可惜。

09:31.067 --> 09:33.933
Looks like you'll have
to start over.
看起来你会有
重新开始。

09:33.933 --> 09:35.067
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:35.067 --> 09:36.800
Enjoying that ice cream,
Patrick?
一边享受着那份冰淇淋，
帕特里克？

09:36.800 --> 09:37.867
- Yes, I am.
- 我是。

09:37.867 --> 09:40.400
- Would you like
sprinkles on it?
- 你愿意吗
洒在上面吗？

09:40.400 --> 09:41.433
- Hey!
- 嘿！

09:45.333 --> 09:47.967
- Jeepers,
I didn't see that coming.
- 吉普车，
我没有预见到这一点。

09:49.300 --> 09:51.600
- You don't leave
until I say so!
-你别离开
直到我这么说！

09:51.600 --> 09:54.667
[both growling]
[双方咆哮]

09:54.667 --> 09:56.800
- Sandy to Gary,
Sandy to Gary,
- 桑迪对加里说，
桑迪对加里说：

09:56.800 --> 09:58.800
how serious
is the situation?
多么严重
情况如何？

09:58.800 --> 10:01.033
- [mewling]
- [呜咽]

10:01.033 --> 10:02.833
- Oh, I didn't think this
all the way through.
-哦，我没想到这个
一路过去。

10:02.833 --> 10:04.733
I've got to shut this down!
我必须把这个关掉！

10:04.733 --> 10:06.067
[alarm buzzing]
[警报声响起]

10:06.067 --> 10:08.167
- Aha!
I want my free--
- 啊哈！
我想要我的自由——

10:11.133 --> 10:14.233
- Open the door!
The experiment is over!
- 打开门！
实验结束了！

10:14.233 --> 10:15.767
Open the door!
开门！

10:15.767 --> 10:17.433
- You heard Sandy.
Open the door!
- 你听到桑迪的话了。
开门！

10:17.433 --> 10:19.367
- You open it!
- No, you open it!
- 你打开它！
- 不，你打开它！

10:19.367 --> 10:22.000
- No, you open it!
[explosion]
- 不，你打开它！
[爆炸]

10:22.000 --> 10:24.933
- Mr. Pavlovi,
tell SpongeBob to open the door!
- 巴甫洛维先生，
告诉海绵宝宝开门！

10:24.933 --> 10:28.433
- It's me, Sandy!
- 是我，桑迪！

10:28.433 --> 10:29.900
The experiment is over!
实验结束了！

10:29.900 --> 10:32.033
- But we didn't even finish
counting the sand.
- 但我们还没完成
数沙子。

10:32.033 --> 10:33.967
- I didn't care
about the sand.
- 我不在乎
关于沙子。

10:33.967 --> 10:36.267
I just wanted to observe you
acting naturally,
我只是想观察你
表现自然，

10:36.267 --> 10:38.567
so I hid microphones and cameras
around your house--
所以我隐藏了麦克风和摄像头
你家周围——

10:38.567 --> 10:40.300
both: Cameras?
两人：相机？

10:43.433 --> 10:45.133
- Et tu, Gary?
- 你呢，加里？

10:45.133 --> 10:46.700
- [meows]
- [喵]

10:46.700 --> 10:49.467
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

10:49.467 --> 10:52.967
I was a monster.
我是一个怪物。

10:52.967 --> 10:57.200
I deserve a C-minus.
我应该得到 C-。

10:57.200 --> 10:59.367
- Aw, Patrick, don't be
so hard on yourself.
- 噢，帕特里克，别这样
对自己太苛刻了。

10:59.367 --> 11:02.133
It was the experiment's fault
that you were such a jerk.
这是实验的错
你真是个混蛋。

11:02.133 --> 11:04.800
- I blame science,
stupid science.
- 我责怪科学，
愚蠢的科学。

11:04.800 --> 11:06.933
- Everybody gets
an A-plus
- 每个人都得到
A+

11:06.933 --> 11:09.100
and-a ice-a cream-a!
还有-一个冰-一个奶油-一个！

11:09.100 --> 11:12.900
[both laughing and cheering]
[又笑又欢呼]

11:12.900 --> 11:14.800
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

11:14.800 --> 11:16.800
What is going on?
到底是怎么回事？

11:18.367 --> 11:20.067
I know it's
a stupid question,
我知道这是
一个愚蠢的问题，

11:20.067 --> 11:22.233
but is there
any ice cream left?
但有吗
还有冰淇淋吗？

11:22.233 --> 11:25.433
- Oh...eesh,
sorry, we're all out.
- 哦...哎呀，
抱歉，我们都出去了。

11:25.433 --> 11:27.867
- You ate it all?
You animals!
- 你都吃完了吗？
你们这些动物！

11:27.867 --> 11:30.233
You didn't even leave me
one drop?
你甚至没有离开我
一滴？

11:30.233 --> 11:32.567
There's got to be
some left in here!
一定有
有些还留在这儿！

11:32.567 --> 11:35.133
[crying]
[哭泣]

11:35.133 --> 11:37.933
- Now let the real
experiment begin.
- 现在让真正的
实验开始。

11:37.933 --> 11:39.633
- Come on!
Get in my mouth!
- 快点！
快到我嘴里来吧！

11:39.633 --> 11:41.300
Oh, this one's empty!
哦，这个是空的！

11:45.133 --> 11:48.333
[soft tropical music]
[轻柔的热带音乐]

[轻柔的热带音乐]